        "code": "// Create a view named 'active_users' based on the 'users' collection\ndb.createView(\n    \"active_users\", // Name of the view\n    \"users\",        // Source collection\n    [ { $match: { status: \"A\" } } ] // Pipeline\n);\n\n// Now you can query the view exactly like a normal collection:\ndb.active_users.find();",
