        "explanation": "**Embedding** nests data physically. Pros: 1 query, atomic updates. Cons: Data duplication, 16MB limit. Example: A blog post and its tags.\n\n**Referencing** links data via IDs. Pros: No duplication, small documents. Cons: Requires `$lookup` or multiple queries, no atomic cross-document updates. Example: A book and its author.",
