        "tip": "Use `db.collection.aggregate([pipeline]).explain()` to see exactly how the optimizer rewrote your pipeline.",
        "mistake": "Assuming the pipeline executes exactly as written. The optimizer is smart, but you should still write logical pipelines (filter early).",
        "summary": "The pipeline is parsed, optimized (stages reordered for efficiency), and executed sequentially in memory, streaming data from one stage to the next."
