        "language": "javascript",
        "explanation": "`$lookup` performs a Left Outer Join. It is notoriously resource-intensive because it essentially executes a sub-query for every document passing through the pipeline. To optimize it:\n1. **Index the Foreign Key:** The `foreignField` in the target collection MUST be indexed, otherwise every lookup causes a full collection scan.\n2. **Filter First:** Reduce the number of documents in the primary collection before the `$lookup` stage.",
