        "explanation": "The Operations Log (`oplog.rs`) is a special capped collection in the `local` database of every replica set member. It records all operations that modify data. Crucially, the operations are transformed to be **idempotent** (applying them once has the same result as applying them a thousand times). Secondaries tail this collection to replicate state.",
