        "language": "javascript",
        "explanation": "The Balancer is a background process running on the Config Servers of a sharded cluster. Its job is to monitor the number of chunks on each shard. If one shard has significantly more chunks than another (an imbalance), the balancer automatically migrates chunks from the heavily loaded shard to the lighter one.",
        "example": "Self-healing.",
