        "explanation": "Chunk migrations are triggered by:\n1. **Imbalance:** One shard has more chunks than the migration threshold allows compared to other shards.\n2. **Adding a Shard:** When you add a new, empty server to the cluster, the balancer immediately starts migrating chunks to it to utilize the new space.\n3. **Removing a Shard:** When you decommission a server, all its chunks must be evacuated to the remaining servers.\n4. **Zoning Violations:** A chunk violates a Zoned Sharding rule and must be moved to the correct zone.",
